{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-32984","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37602","text":"ADR-0004: Telemetry Integrity & Attribution Model (Deployment-Scoped Signed Events)"}]},{"id":"blk-32985","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37603","text":"Status: Accepted (v1) Date: 2026-01-21 Decision Makers: Engineering Related Docs:"}]},{"id":"blk-32986","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32988","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37604","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/00_MASTER_SPEC.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32987","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32990","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37605","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32989","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32992","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37606","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/20_RUNTIME_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32991","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37607","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32993","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32996","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37608","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/40_SECURITY_SECRETS_COMPLIANCE.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32995","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-32998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37609","marks":["code"],"text":"WebHost.Systems/docs/spec/50_OBSERVABILITY_BILLING_LIMITS.md"}]}],"id":"blk-32997","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-32999","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37610","text":"Context"}]},{"id":"blk-33000","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37611","text":"webhost.systems is a multi-runtime AI agent platform. For each invocation executed in the data plane (Cloudflare Workers/DO or AWS Bedrock AgentCore), the platform must record usage and operational telemetry for:"}]},{"id":"blk-33001","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37612","text":"plan enforcement (requests/tokens/compute limits),"}]}],"id":"blk-33002","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37613","text":"cost estimation (v1: estimated cost),"}]}],"id":"blk-33004","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37614","text":"billing integrity (tier gating and upgrade flows),"}]}],"id":"blk-33006","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33009","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37615","text":"observability (error rates, latency/compute, tool usage),"}]}],"id":"blk-33008","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33011","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37616","text":"audits and support (traceability via "},{"id":"spn-37617","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-37618","text":", deploy version, runtime)."}]}],"id":"blk-33010","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37619","text":"Telemetry is consumed by the control plane and stored as append-only raw events ("},{"id":"spn-37620","marks":["code"],"text":"metricsEvents"},{"id":"spn-37621","text":") and aggregated views ("},{"id":"spn-37622","marks":["code"],"text":"billingUsage"},{"id":"spn-37623","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-33013","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37624","text":"Problem statement"}]},{"id":"blk-33014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37625","text":"Telemetry is a critical security and business integrity surface. If telemetry is spoofable or not attributable, an attacker (or buggy runtime) could:"}]},{"id":"blk-33015","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33017","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37626","text":"underreport usage to avoid limits or billing,"}]}],"id":"blk-33016","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33019","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37627","text":"overreport usage to sabotage another tenant,"}]}],"id":"blk-33018","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33021","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37628","text":"inject events for another tenant’s agents/deployments,"}]}],"id":"blk-33020","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33023","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37629","text":"create ambiguity in chargeback attribution across runtimes,"}]}],"id":"blk-33022","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33025","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37630","text":"break observability and incident response."}]}],"id":"blk-33024","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37631","text":"Therefore telemetry ingestion must ensure:"}]},{"id":"blk-33027","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37632","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-37633","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integrity"},{"id":"spn-37634","text":": payload not tampered in transit. 2. "},{"id":"spn-37635","marks":["bold"],"text":"Authenticity"},{"id":"spn-37636","text":": sender is an authorized runtime deployment. 3. "},{"id":"spn-37637","marks":["bold"],"text":"Attribution"},{"id":"spn-37638","text":": event belongs to exactly one "},{"id":"spn-37639","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId, runtimeProvider}"},{"id":"spn-37640","text":". 4. "},{"id":"spn-37641","marks":["bold"],"text":"Replay safety"},{"id":"spn-37642","text":": retries do not double count; attackers cannot re-submit old events to alter usage. 5. "},{"id":"spn-37643","marks":["bold"],"text":"No secrets leakage"},{"id":"spn-37644","text":": telemetry must never include secret values, and telemetry auth secrets must not be stored as plaintext."}]},{"id":"blk-33028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37645","text":"Constraints:"}]},{"id":"blk-33029","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33031","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37646","text":"Data plane runtimes are heterogeneous and may differ in what usage details they can report."}]}],"id":"blk-33030","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33033","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37647","text":"Customer agent code is untrusted; it may attempt to forge telemetry or call arbitrary endpoints."}]}],"id":"blk-33032","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33035","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37648","text":"Telemetry ingestion must not rely on browser sessions/cookies."}]}],"id":"blk-33034","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33037","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37649","text":"The system must remain implementable for v1 without introducing a full centralized vault or complex PKI."}]}],"id":"blk-33036","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33038","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37650","text":"Decision"}]},{"id":"blk-33039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37651","text":"Adopt a "},{"id":"spn-37652","marks":["bold"],"text":"deployment-scoped signed telemetry event"},{"id":"spn-37653","text":" model with "},{"id":"spn-37654","marks":["bold"],"text":"ownership cross-checking"},{"id":"spn-37655","text":" at ingestion."}]},{"id":"blk-33040","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37656","text":"Decision summary (normative)"}]},{"id":"blk-33041","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37657","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-37658","marks":["bold"],"text":"Attribution is mandatory"},{"id":"spn-37659","text":" Every telemetry event MUST be attributable to:"}]},{"id":"blk-33042","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37660","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"}]}],"id":"blk-33043","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33046","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37661","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33045","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33048","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37662","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33047","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33050","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37663","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"}]}],"id":"blk-33049","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33052","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37664","marks":["code"],"text":"timestamp"}]}],"id":"blk-33051","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33053","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37665","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-37666","marks":["bold"],"text":"Telemetry integrity uses deployment-scoped HMAC signatures (v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-33054","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33056","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37667","text":"Each deployment has a unique "},{"id":"spn-37668","marks":["code"],"text":"telemetrySecret"},{"id":"spn-37669","text":" (HMAC key), generated by the control plane."}]}],"id":"blk-33055","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33058","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37670","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-37671","marks":["code"],"text":"telemetrySecret"},{"id":"spn-37672","text":" is injected into the deployed runtime using provider secret mechanisms."}]}],"id":"blk-33057","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33060","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37673","text":"Data plane submits telemetry to the control plane ingestion endpoint with:"}]}],"id":"blk-33059","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33062","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37674","text":"header "},{"id":"spn-37675","marks":["code"],"text":"X-Telemetry-Deployment-Id: <deploymentId>"}]}],"id":"blk-33061","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33064","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37676","text":"header "},{"id":"spn-37677","marks":["code"],"text":"X-Telemetry-Signature: v1=<hex(hmac_sha256(raw_body_bytes, telemetrySecret))>"}]}],"id":"blk-33063","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37678","text":"Control plane verifies:"}]}],"id":"blk-33065","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33068","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37679","text":"signature validity (using deployment-scoped secret reference),"}]}],"id":"blk-33067","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33070","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37680","text":"ownership mapping: deployment belongs to the agent and user in the payload,"}]}],"id":"blk-33069","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33072","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37681","text":"required fields and enums."}]}],"id":"blk-33071","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37682","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-37683","marks":["bold"],"text":"Ingestion performs ownership cross-check (defense in depth)"},{"id":"spn-37684","text":" After signature validation, ingestion MUST query control plane data and verify:"}]},{"id":"blk-33074","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33076","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37685","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments._id == deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33075","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33078","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37686","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.agentId == agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33077","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33080","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37687","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.userId == userId"}]}],"id":"blk-33079","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37688","text":"If any mismatch: reject the event, optionally record an "},{"id":"spn-37689","marks":["code"],"text":"auditLog"},{"id":"spn-37690","text":" entry with sanitized details."}]},{"id":"blk-33082","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37691","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-37692","marks":["bold"],"text":"Telemetry does not use user auth"},{"id":"spn-37693","text":" Telemetry ingestion MUST NOT accept browser session cookies as authentication. Telemetry is authenticated solely by deployment-scoped signature (and optional anti-replay)."}]},{"id":"blk-33083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37694","text":"5. "},{"id":"spn-37695","marks":["bold"],"text":"Replay/dedupe (recommended in v1; mandatory before public invocations)"},{"id":"spn-37696","text":" Telemetry ingestion SHOULD implement one of:"}]},{"id":"blk-33084","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33086","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37697","marks":["code"],"text":"eventId"},{"id":"spn-37698","text":" (UUID generated by data plane) + short-window dedupe store, OR"}]}],"id":"blk-33085","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33088","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37699","text":"dedupe on "},{"id":"spn-37700","marks":["code"],"text":"(deploymentId, traceId)"},{"id":"spn-37701","text":" if "},{"id":"spn-37702","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-37703","text":" uniqueness per invocation is guaranteed."}]}],"id":"blk-33087","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33089","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37704","text":"In either case, ingestion must be idempotent under retries to prevent double counting."}]},{"id":"blk-33090","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37705","text":"6. "},{"id":"spn-37706","marks":["bold"],"text":"Secrets are never stored as plaintext in the primary DB"}]},{"id":"blk-33091","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33093","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37707","text":"The primary DB stores only metadata and secret references (e.g., provider secret name/id)."}]}],"id":"blk-33092","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33095","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37708","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-37709","marks":["code"],"text":"telemetrySecret"},{"id":"spn-37710","text":" value MUST NOT be stored in plaintext in the primary database (Supabase)."}]}],"id":"blk-33094","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33096","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37711","text":"Provider-specific telemetry capabilities (implementation guidance)"}]},{"id":"blk-33097","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37712","text":"This ADR standardizes telemetry ingestion on "},{"id":"spn-37713","marks":["bold"],"text":"deployment-scoped signed events"},{"id":"spn-37714","text":" for all runtimes. Provider capabilities vary, but the v1 baseline remains consistent."}]},{"id":"blk-33098","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37715","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cloudflare (Workers + Durable Objects):"}]},{"id":"blk-33099","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33101","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37716","text":"The runtime MUST explicitly emit telemetry to the control plane (Pattern A: in-workload emission is the preferred approach)."}]}],"id":"blk-33100","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33103","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37717","text":"The telemetry signing secret is injected via Worker secret bindings."}]}],"id":"blk-33102","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33105","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37718","text":"The Worker/DO submits "},{"id":"spn-37719","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /v1/telemetry/report"},{"id":"spn-37720","text":" with "},{"id":"spn-37721","marks":["code"],"text":"X-Telemetry-Deployment-Id"},{"id":"spn-37722","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-37723","marks":["code"],"text":"X-Telemetry-Signature"},{"id":"spn-37724","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33104","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33106","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37725","marks":["bold"],"text":"AgentCore (AWS Bedrock AgentCore):"}]},{"id":"blk-33107","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33109","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37726","text":"AgentCore may provide provider-native observability capabilities (e.g., service-level telemetry/OTel-style integrations) that can be valuable for deep debugging."}]}],"id":"blk-33108","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33111","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37727","marks":["bold"],"text":"v1 baseline:"},{"id":"spn-37728","text":" use the same direct signed submission model as Cloudflare (either in-workload emission when feasible, or adapter-side emission when required by provider constraints) to keep metering, limits, and billing semantics consistent across runtimes."}]}],"id":"blk-33110","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33113","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37729","marks":["bold"],"text":"post-v1 enhancement:"},{"id":"spn-37730","text":" integrate provider-native observability for richer traces while still emitting the normalized, signed metering event used for billing and limits."}]}],"id":"blk-33112","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33114","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37731","text":"Rationale"}]},{"id":"blk-33115","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37732","text":"This approach satisfies the requirements with minimal complexity:"}]},{"id":"blk-33116","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33118","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37733","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integrity and authenticity"},{"id":"spn-37734","text":": HMAC signatures prevent tampering and authenticate possession of a deployment-scoped secret."}]}],"id":"blk-33117","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37735","marks":["bold"],"text":"Tenant protection"},{"id":"spn-37736","text":": ownership cross-check prevents a compromised deployment secret from being used to write events for a different agent or user."}]}],"id":"blk-33119","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33122","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37737","marks":["bold"],"text":"Least privilege"},{"id":"spn-37738","text":": deployment-scoped secret limits blast radius if compromised."}]}],"id":"blk-33121","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33124","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37739","marks":["bold"],"text":"Provider portability"},{"id":"spn-37740","text":": works across runtimes because it relies on a generic “can send HTTP + store secret” capability."}]}],"id":"blk-33123","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37741","marks":["bold"],"text":"Operable MVP"},{"id":"spn-37742","text":": avoids the need for PKI or an always-online centralized vault, while still enabling strong guarantees."}]}],"id":"blk-33125","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33127","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37743","text":"Alternatives considered"}]},{"id":"blk-33128","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37744","text":"A) Trust telemetry without signatures (reject)"}]},{"id":"blk-33129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37745","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33130","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37746","text":"Easiest to implement."}]}],"id":"blk-33131","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37747","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33134","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33136","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37748","text":"Enables trivial spoofing and billing manipulation."}]}],"id":"blk-33135","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33138","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37749","text":"Allows cross-tenant sabotage and incorrect usage enforcement."}]}],"id":"blk-33137","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33139","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37750","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision"},{"id":"spn-37751","text":" Rejected. Not acceptable for any paid system with limits and billing."}]},{"id":"blk-33140","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37752","text":"B) Adapter-side telemetry only (partial alternative)"}]},{"id":"blk-33141","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37753","text":"Telemetry is emitted only by the control plane adapter after it receives provider responses."}]},{"id":"blk-33142","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37754","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33143","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33145","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37755","text":"Avoids injecting telemetry secrets into runtime code."}]}],"id":"blk-33144","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37756","text":"Avoids runtime outbound call to control plane."}]}],"id":"blk-33146","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33148","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37757","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33149","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33151","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37758","text":"Often cannot capture provider-specific usage (compute/tool usage) reliably."}]}],"id":"blk-33150","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33153","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37759","text":"Creates attribution gaps if invocations happen outside the adapter path or if provider returns incomplete usage."}]}],"id":"blk-33152","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33155","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37760","text":"Weakens correlation with runtime events and can undercount."}]}],"id":"blk-33154","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37761","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision"},{"id":"spn-37762","text":" Not the primary model. Allowed as a constrained fallback if a provider cannot support in-workload emission, but must preserve integrity and attribution. If adapter emits, it must still attach to a deployment and enforce ownership; it must not be forgeable by clients."}]},{"id":"blk-33157","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37763","text":"C) Per-user telemetry keys (reject)"}]},{"id":"blk-33158","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37764","text":"Use one key per user shared across all deployments."}]},{"id":"blk-33159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37765","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33160","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33162","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37766","text":"Fewer secrets."}]}],"id":"blk-33161","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37767","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33164","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33166","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37768","text":"Massive blast radius if compromised; compromised deployment can spoof across all user deployments."}]}],"id":"blk-33165","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37769","text":"Harder to rotate safely and isolate issues."}]}],"id":"blk-33167","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33169","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37770","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision"},{"id":"spn-37771","text":" Rejected. Deployment-scoped keys are safer and align with immutability and auditability."}]},{"id":"blk-33170","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37772","text":"D) Public-key signatures (PKI) per deployment (defer)"}]},{"id":"blk-33171","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37773","text":"Each deployment gets a keypair; telemetry signed with private key, verified with public key."}]},{"id":"blk-33172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37774","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33173","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37775","text":"No shared secret at ingestion; avoids secret distribution to verifier."}]}],"id":"blk-33174","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33177","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37776","text":"Strong cryptographic model."}]}],"id":"blk-33176","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37777","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33179","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33181","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37778","text":"Adds key management complexity; still needs secure private key injection to runtime."}]}],"id":"blk-33180","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37779","text":"Higher implementation overhead for v1 without clear ROI."}]}],"id":"blk-33182","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33184","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37780","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision"},{"id":"spn-37781","text":" Deferred. Consider post-v1 if you need stronger non-repudiation or third-party verification."}]},{"id":"blk-33185","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37782","text":"E) mTLS between data plane and control plane (defer)"}]},{"id":"blk-33186","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37783","text":"Use mutual TLS with client certs per deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-33187","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37784","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pros"}]},{"id":"blk-33188","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37785","text":"Strong channel-level authentication."}]}],"id":"blk-33189","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33191","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37786","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cons"}]},{"id":"blk-33192","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37787","text":"Operationally heavy; certificate issuance/rotation complexity."}]}],"id":"blk-33193","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33196","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37788","text":"Hard to implement uniformly across runtimes."}]}],"id":"blk-33195","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37789","marks":["bold"],"text":"Decision"},{"id":"spn-37790","text":" Deferred. Potential future hardening for enterprise tiers."}]},{"id":"blk-33198","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37791","text":"Detailed design (normative)"}]},{"id":"blk-33199","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37792","text":"1) Telemetry event schema (minimum viable)"}]},{"id":"blk-33200","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37793","text":"Telemetry payload MUST include:"}]},{"id":"blk-33201","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37794","marks":["code"],"text":"userId"},{"id":"spn-37795","text":" (internal id)"}]}],"id":"blk-33202","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33205","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37796","marks":["code"],"text":"agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33204","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33207","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37797","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33206","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33209","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37798","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-37799","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-37800","marks":["code"],"text":"cloudflare"},{"id":"spn-37801","text":" | "},{"id":"spn-37802","marks":["code"],"text":"agentcore"},{"id":"spn-37803","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-33208","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33211","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37804","marks":["code"],"text":"timestamp"},{"id":"spn-37805","text":" (RFC3339 or unix ms; ingestion converts to unix ms)"}]}],"id":"blk-33210","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33213","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37806","marks":["code"],"text":"requests"},{"id":"spn-37807","text":" (typically 1)"}]}],"id":"blk-33212","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33215","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37808","marks":["code"],"text":"llmTokens"},{"id":"spn-37809","text":" (reported or estimated)"}]}],"id":"blk-33214","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33217","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37810","marks":["code"],"text":"computeMs"},{"id":"spn-37811","text":" (wall time or billed time, defined per provider)"}]}],"id":"blk-33216","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37812","marks":["code"],"text":"errors"},{"id":"spn-37813","text":" (0/1 typical)"}]}],"id":"blk-33218","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33221","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37814","marks":["code"],"text":"errorClass"},{"id":"spn-37815","text":" (optional: "},{"id":"spn-37816","marks":["code"],"text":"auth | limit | runtime | tool | unknown"},{"id":"spn-37817","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-33220","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37818","marks":["code"],"text":"costUsdEstimated"}]}],"id":"blk-33222","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33225","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37819","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-37820","text":" (optional but recommended)"}]}],"id":"blk-33224","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33227","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37821","marks":["code"],"text":"provider"},{"id":"spn-37822","text":" (optional runtime-specific counters)"}]}],"id":"blk-33226","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37823","text":"Telemetry MUST NOT include:"}]},{"id":"blk-33229","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33231","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37824","text":"plaintext secrets,"}]}],"id":"blk-33230","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33233","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37825","text":"full prompts/responses by default (unless an explicit opt-in feature is added later),"}]}],"id":"blk-33232","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33235","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37826","text":"raw provider credential material."}]}],"id":"blk-33234","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33236","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37827","text":"2) Signature computation"}]},{"id":"blk-33237","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33239","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37828","text":"Signature is computed over the exact raw request body bytes as received/sent."}]}],"id":"blk-33238","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33241","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37829","text":"Algorithm: "},{"id":"spn-37830","marks":["code"],"text":"HMAC_SHA256(telemetrySecret, raw_body_bytes)"},{"id":"spn-37831","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33240","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37832","text":"Encoding: hex lowercase recommended."}]}],"id":"blk-33242","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33245","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37833","text":"Header format: "},{"id":"spn-37834","marks":["code"],"text":"X-Telemetry-Signature: v1=<hex>"},{"id":"spn-37835","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-33244","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33246","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37836","text":"Canonicalization note:"}]},{"id":"blk-33247","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33249","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37837","text":"The verifier MUST use the raw body bytes, not a re-serialized JSON object."}]}],"id":"blk-33248","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37838","text":"If your framework modifies request bodies, capture raw bytes before parsing."}]}],"id":"blk-33250","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33252","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37839","text":"3) Ingestion validation steps (MUST)"}]},{"id":"blk-33253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37840","text":"In order: 1. Read "},{"id":"spn-37841","marks":["code"],"text":"deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-37842","text":" header and locate deployment record. 2. Fetch deployment-scoped secret reference and verify signature. 3. Parse JSON body and validate required fields and enums. 4. Ownership cross-check:"}]},{"id":"blk-33254","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33256","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37843","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.userId == body.userId"}]}],"id":"blk-33255","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33258","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37844","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments.agentId == body.agentId"}]}],"id":"blk-33257","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33260","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37845","marks":["code"],"text":"deployments._id == body.deploymentId"},{"id":"spn-37846","text":" (or match header)"}]}],"id":"blk-33259","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33261","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37847","text":"5. Dedupe/idempotency:"}]},{"id":"blk-33262","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33264","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37848","text":"if "},{"id":"spn-37849","marks":["code"],"text":"eventId"},{"id":"spn-37850","text":" used: reject or no-op if already processed in dedupe window"}]}],"id":"blk-33263","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33266","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37851","text":"if "},{"id":"spn-37852","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-37853","text":" used: ensure uniqueness per "},{"id":"spn-37854","marks":["code"],"text":"(deploymentId, traceId)"},{"id":"spn-37855","text":" in dedupe window"}]}],"id":"blk-33265","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33267","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37856","text":"6. Persist event append-only. 7. Optionally update incremental counters."}]},{"id":"blk-33268","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37857","text":"If any step fails:"}]},{"id":"blk-33269","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33271","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37858","text":"respond with normalized error (for non-telemetry callers, keep generic),"}]}],"id":"blk-33270","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33273","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37859","text":"DO NOT reveal secret or internal details,"}]}],"id":"blk-33272","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33275","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37860","text":"optionally write a sanitized "},{"id":"spn-37861","marks":["code"],"text":"auditLog"},{"id":"spn-37862","text":" entry for investigation."}]}],"id":"blk-33274","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33276","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37863","text":"4) Secret generation and rotation"}]},{"id":"blk-33277","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33279","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37864","text":"Generate a new telemetry secret on every new deployment by default."}]}],"id":"blk-33278","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33281","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37865","text":"Inject the secret into the runtime provider as a secret (not as plain env var stored in DB)."}]}],"id":"blk-33280","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37866","text":"Rotation policy:"}]}],"id":"blk-33282","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33285","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37867","text":"New deployment => new telemetry secret (mandatory)."}]}],"id":"blk-33284","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37868","text":"Old deployments retain old secret for the duration they might emit telemetry (but they should not emit after deactivation, except in-flight retries)."}]}],"id":"blk-33286","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33289","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37869","text":"Keep verification capability for a bounded time window after deactivation to allow late telemetry retries."}]}],"id":"blk-33288","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33290","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37870","text":"5) Telemetry retries and ingestion availability"}]},{"id":"blk-33291","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33293","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37871","text":"Data plane SHOULD retry telemetry submission with exponential backoff (bounded)."}]}],"id":"blk-33292","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33295","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37872","text":"Data plane SHOULD NOT block user-visible invocation completion while retrying telemetry."}]}],"id":"blk-33294","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33297","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37873","text":"Control plane SHOULD expose internal health metrics for telemetry ingestion rate and rejection counts."}]}],"id":"blk-33296","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33298","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37874","text":"Consequences"}]},{"id":"blk-33299","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37875","text":"Positive"}]},{"id":"blk-33300","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37876","text":"Strong billing and limits integrity foundation."}]}],"id":"blk-33301","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33304","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37877","text":"Provider-agnostic design that scales to new runtimes."}]}],"id":"blk-33303","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33306","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37878","text":"Reduced blast radius via deployment-scoped secrets."}]}],"id":"blk-33305","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37879","text":"Clear audit path for telemetry failures and spoof attempts."}]}],"id":"blk-33307","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33309","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37880","text":"Negative / tradeoffs"}]},{"id":"blk-33310","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33312","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37881","text":"Requires deploying a telemetry secret per deployment and managing injection per provider."}]}],"id":"blk-33311","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33314","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37882","text":"Requires careful handling of raw request bytes for correct signature verification."}]}],"id":"blk-33313","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37883","text":"Adds complexity to runtime code (Pattern A emission) or to adapters (Pattern B emission)."}]}],"id":"blk-33315","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33317","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37884","text":"Implementation requirements (checklist)"}]},{"id":"blk-33318","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37885","text":"[ ] Each deployment has a telemetry signing secret generated by the control plane."}]}],"id":"blk-33319","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37886","text":"[ ] Secret is injected into the runtime provider using provider secret mechanisms."}]}],"id":"blk-33321","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37887","text":"[ ] Telemetry endpoint verifies signature using raw request body bytes."}]}],"id":"blk-33323","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33326","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37888","text":"[ ] Telemetry endpoint cross-checks "},{"id":"spn-37889","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId}"},{"id":"spn-37890","text":" ownership."}]}],"id":"blk-33325","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33328","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37891","text":"[ ] Telemetry endpoint is not authenticated via browser sessions/cookies."}]}],"id":"blk-33327","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37892","text":"[ ] Telemetry ingestion is idempotent under retries (dedupe window)."}]}],"id":"blk-33329","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33332","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37893","text":"[ ] Telemetry payloads do not include secret values or full prompt contents by default."}]}],"id":"blk-33331","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33334","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37894","text":"[ ] Telemetry rejection and signature failures are auditable (sanitized audit log)."}]}],"id":"blk-33333","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-33335","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37895","text":"Acceptance criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-33336","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37896","text":"This ADR is considered correctly implemented when:"}]},{"id":"blk-33337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37897","text":"1. A valid telemetry payload signed with the correct deployment secret is accepted and persisted. 2. The same payload with an invalid signature is rejected and not persisted. 3. A valid signature with mismatched ownership (deployment belongs to a different agent/user) is rejected. 4. Retried telemetry submissions do not cause double-counting within the dedupe strategy window. 5. No plaintext telemetry secret values exist in the primary DB. 6. Telemetry events are attributable to "},{"id":"spn-37898","marks":["code"],"text":"{userId, agentId, deploymentId, runtimeProvider}"},{"id":"spn-37899","text":" and can be aggregated reliably for billing and limits."}]},{"id":"blk-33338","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37900","text":"Follow-ups"}]},{"id":"blk-33339","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37901","text":"ADR-0005: Deployment immutability + active pointer model (if not already documented as ADR)."}]}],"id":"blk-33340","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33343","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37902","text":"Define a standardized "},{"id":"spn-37903","marks":["code"],"text":"eventId"},{"id":"spn-37904","text":" policy if traceId uniqueness cannot be guaranteed."}]}],"id":"blk-33342","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37905","text":"Consider stronger anti-replay guarantees (timestamp window + dedupe store) before enabling public agent invocations."}]}],"id":"blk-33344","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-33347","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37906","text":"Consider future hardening for enterprise tiers (PKI signatures or mTLS) if required by compliance/security posture."}]}],"id":"blk-33346","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierahrcqmqxyheosnz2gcfdvq3u5lrdot43r3u65lcvh6ufbgnb2ckhq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}